job-description-novice = Mechanicus Acolyte: assist senior tech-priests and learn the rites of the Omnissiah.
job-description-recruit = Learn basic detention procedures and brig protocols. Listen to your superiors and ask for help when needed.
job-description-magos = Mechanicus Magos: lead the machine cult and set engineering priorities.
job-description-first-assistant = Manage access rights fairly via the ID console, run service operations, and keep Ian safe.
job-description-head-officer = Lead your security staff, suppress dissent, and ensure the safety of command personnel.
job-description-voidsman = Hunt down criminals and enemies, uphold law and order, and keep the station from descending into chaos.
job-description-gunnery-sergeant = Patrol the armory sector, prevent theft, and ensure all prisoners are processed and released on time.
job-description-enginseer = Enginseer: maintain machinery and bless the spirits of the Omnissiah.
job-description-explorator = Mechanicus Explorator: gather resources and recover archaeotech.
job-description-genetor = Mechanicus Genetor: conduct bio-research and support medical-biological operations.
job-description-lexmechanic = Lexmechanic: process tactical data and maintain information networks.

job-description-colonel = Command the Astra Militarum regiment, distribute forces, and hold the front.
job-description-commissar = Enforce regiment discipline and suppress panic in the Emperor's name.
job-description-lieutenant = Lead your platoon, relay orders, and coordinate squads.
job-description-sergeant-hws = Command the heavy weapons team and control key fire positions.
job-description-sergeant-sws = Coordinate the special weapons team for breakthroughs and counterattacks.
job-description-sergeant = Lead your squad in battle and hold the firing line.
job-description-tank-comm = Command a Leman Russ crew and support infantry with armored firepower.
job-description-specialist-hws = Deploy heavy weapons and suppress fortified enemy positions.
job-description-specialist-sws = Use special weapons effectively at close and medium range.
job-description-tanker = Operate armored vehicles as part of a tank crew.
job-description-medic = Treat the wounded and return soldiers to combat readiness.
job-description-guardsman = Backbone of the Astra Militarum: hold the line and obey command orders.
job-description-psyker = Sanctioned Imperium psyker: wield the warp under control and avoid perils.
job-description-vox-scout = Serve as vox operator: recon, communications, and target designation for the squad.
job-description-tithe-supplier = Keep Munitorum frontline logistics moving: process requisitions, deliver supplies, and maintain the regiment cargo loop.
job-description-munitorum-officer = Coordinate regiment supply priorities, oversee requisitions, and keep the Munitorum network functioning under fire.

job-description-hcolonel = Lead the renegade warband, keep pressure on the enemy, and break Imperium defenses.
job-description-hlieutenant = Warband champion: lead assault groups and eliminate resistance pockets.
job-description-hsergeant-hws = Coordinate corrupted heavy weapons to breach fortified lines.
job-description-hsergeant-sws = Lead special-weapon operatives during close-range breakthroughs.
job-description-hsergeant = Command the renegade squad and maintain offensive tempo.
job-description-htank-comm = Command renegade armor and support the warband's advance.
job-description-hspecialist-hws = Deploy heretic heavy weapons and suppress enemy positions at range.
job-description-hspecialist-sws = Use heretic special weapons for raids and assault pushes.
job-description-htanker = Heretic armor crew: maneuver and frontline fire support.
job-description-hguardsman = Cultist: mass Chaos infantry focused on numbers and close combat pressure.
job-description-hvox-scout = Provide communications and targeting support for heretic squads.
job-description-hband-supplier = Keep the warband supplied through captured cargo channels, illicit trade, and battlefield plunder.
job-description-hmagos = Heretek Magos: expand the machine cults of the Dark Mechanicum.
job-description-hexplorator = Heretek Explorator: recover artifacts and resources for the warband.
job-description-hgenetor = Heretek Genetor: perform forbidden biomodification programs.
job-description-hlexmechanic = Heretek Lexmechanic: hack and reconfigure enemy systems.
job-description-henginseer = Renegade Tech-Priest: maintain machines and profane machine spirits.
job-description-hnovice = Dark Mechanicum Acolyte: serve the hereteks and learn forbidden rites.
